        },
        {
          "text": "Na ambon’ya Yosua mũthembi mũnene aũngamĩte mbee wa mũlaĩka wa Yeova, na Satani aũngamĩte ngalĩ ya kw’oko kwake kwa aũme ethĩwe nthũ yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.1"
            ]
