              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova amwĩa Satani, Yeova nakũkan’ye, we Satani; ĩĩ, Yeova ũla wanyuvie Yelusaleme nakũkan’ye: kĩĩ tĩ kĩsinga kĩvulĩtw’e mwakinĩ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
